        "text_9Wkp6A": {
          "type": "text",
          "name": "t:names.text",
          "settings": {
            "class_name": "",
            "text": "<p>You can return or exchange items within <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">30 days</span> of the invoice date, provided they meet our <strong>Conditions of Return</strong> (listed below).</p><p>To initiate a return or exchange:</p><ol><li>Contact us at <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">(03) 9753 2555</span> or submit the ‘<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Return Request</span>’ form above to obtain a <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Return Authority Number (RA)</span>.</li><li>Return the item within <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">14 days</span> of receiving your RA number.</li></ol><p>Please note that return postage costs are at your expense unless the goods are faulty or incorrectly supplied. Refunds will be issued to the original payment method within <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">5 business days</span> of receiving the return, but may take up to <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">10 business days</span> to process, depending on your financial institution.</p><h4><strong><br/>Conditions of Return</strong></h4><p> </p><p>To qualify for a return, the following conditions must be met:</p><ul><li>Items must be in their original, <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">unworn</span> condition with all tags and labels attached.</li><li>You must include a valid <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Return Authority Number (RA)</span>.</li><li><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Customised items</span> (e.g. embroidered) and <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Final Sale/Clearance items</span> cannot be returned unless faulty or incorrectly supplied.</li><li>Items remain your responsibility until received by us. Please ensure they are securely packaged. We recommend using trackable shipping, as we are not liable for items lost or damaged in transit.</li></ul><h4><strong><br/>Special Conditions</strong></h4><p> </p><ul><li><strong>Afterpay Orders:</strong> Items purchased via Afterpay can only be returned for <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">store credit</span>. Refunds are not available for Afterpay orders.</li><li><strong>Final Sale/Clearance Items:</strong> Final Sale or Clearance items are not eligible for return. Any returned items will be sent back to you at your expense.</li></ul><h4><strong><br/>Return Shipping</strong></h4><p> </p><p>You are responsible for the return shipping costs, which are non-refundable. We recommend using a trackable shipping service to ensure safe delivery.</p>",
